<title>USA: McKesson awarded $150 mln contract.</title>
<headline>McKesson awarded $150 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>McKesson Corp Monday said its McKesson Health Systems unit has signed an exclusive prime-vendor agreement for the supply of pharmaceutical products to  Yankee Alliance Inc.</p>
<p>The multiyear agreement is expected to result in sales to Yankee totaling more than $150 million over the term of the contract.</p>
</text>
